1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,189
Itu tuh dimulai\Ndari situ.

2
00:00:01,189 --> 00:00:02,321
Kenapa ya? Kenapa\Nbegitu?

3
00:00:02,321 --> 00:00:03,000
Kenapa begitu?

4
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:04,067
Dan itu dibiasakan.

5
00:00:04,067 --> 00:00:06,200
Setiap kali ngobrol\Nsama orang, kenapa

6
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:06,950
ya dia begitu?

7
00:00:06,950 --> 00:00:09,000
Kenapa dia punya\Nprinsip seperti itu?

8
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:09,750
Dan coba jawab.

9
00:00:09,750 --> 00:00:11,231
Coba atau tanya\Nke orang yang

10
00:00:11,231 --> 00:00:13,269
langsung. Kenapa menurut\Nlo seperti itu?

11
00:00:13,269 --> 00:00:14,000
Kenapa? Kenapa?

12
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:15,400
Dari satu pertanyaan\Nitu aja.

13
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:17,267
Tentar akarnya tuh\Njadi banyak banget

14
00:00:17,267 --> 00:00:20,183
informasi-informasi yang kalau\Nkita ngomong-ngomong doang

15
00:00:20,183 --> 00:00:21,000
nih yeping doang.

16
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:23,816
Ternyata itu punya\Nbanyak nutrisinya loh

17
00:00:23,816 --> 00:00:25,506
kalau misalkan kita\Ngali.

18
00:00:25,506 --> 00:00:27,598
Nah itu. Dan\Nitu harus dijadikan

19
00:00:27,598 --> 00:00:28,000
habit.

20
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:29,720
Karena kadang kita\Nngobrol cuma kayak

21
00:00:29,720 --> 00:00:32,247
survey-survey saya gitu\Nkan ringan-ringan-ringan karena

22
00:00:32,247 --> 00:00:33,000
kita males mikir.

23
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:34,283
Tapi coba deh.

24
00:00:34,283 --> 00:00:37,550
Have a mentality\Ndimana lo selalu

25
00:00:37,550 --> 00:00:40,000
ingin tau lebih\Ndari situ.

26
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:41,037
Dan itu tuh\Nhabit.

27
00:00:41,037 --> 00:00:43,185
Bukan karakter. Ya\Ngue orangnya gak

28
00:00:43,185 --> 00:00:44,000
mau tauan sih.

29
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:46,512
Lu gak membiasakan\Ndiri lo untuk

30
00:00:46,512 --> 00:00:49,581
mau tau. Jadi\Nse-discipline sama seperti

31
00:00:49,581 --> 00:00:52,000
aktivitas akitas kita\Nlainnya.
